    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5f33f213927ae55c16a3a43a2dacb592.poster.avif?t=1751682366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5f33f213927ae55c16a3a43a2dacb592.webm?t=1751682366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a hostile alien world. Follow the path of outposts laid down by your missing crew. Navigate dark tunnels, toxic rivers, unstable machinery and erupting lava lakes in a desperate push toward the planet\u2019s core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/834f546ea4a900c9ae814bb0b36a210a.poster.avif?t=1751682366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/834f546ea4a900c9ae814bb0b36a210a.webm?t=1751682366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship\u2019s core before each mission to match the threat ahead. Whether you need tighter control, stronger shielding or zero gravity, each option offers a unique way to survive. Master them all to conquer the planet\u2019s ever-shifting challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5a8bae4effdb20889bf4e40edb7073eb.poster.avif?t=1751682366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5a8bae4effdb20889bf4e40edb7073eb.webm?t=1751682366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emergency pod is not equipped to fight! The craft is fragile and exposed, with no defenses beyond a few shields and your own skill. Avoid deadly hazards, environmental traps, corrupted machines, and the strange forces that seem to anticipate your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5f33f213927ae55c16a3a43a2dacb592.poster.avif?t=1751682366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5f33f213927ae55c16a3a43a2dacb592.webm?t=1751682366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a hostile alien world. Follow the path of outposts laid down by your missing crew. Navigate dark tunnels, toxic rivers, unstable machinery and erupting lava lakes in a desperate push toward the planet\u2019s core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/834f546ea4a900c9ae814bb0b36a210a.poster.avif?t=1751682366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/834f546ea4a900c9ae814bb0b36a210a.webm?t=1751682366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship\u2019s core before each mission to match the threat ahead. Whether you need tighter control, stronger shielding or zero gravity, each option offers a unique way to survive. Master them all to conquer the planet\u2019s ever-shifting challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5a8bae4effdb20889bf4e40edb7073eb.poster.avif?t=1751682366\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616850/extras/5a8bae4effdb20889bf4e40edb7073eb.webm?t=1751682366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emergency pod is not equipped to fight! The craft is fragile and exposed, with no defenses beyond a few shields and your own skill. Avoid deadly hazards, environmental traps, corrupted machines, and the strange forces that seem to anticipate your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Cleared for Impact is a 2D precision flying simulator. Navigate the depths of a hostile world, avoid obstacles, dodge lasers and rescue your crew!",
